---

Third-party material in this repository:

- assets/fonts/Inter.ttf and the glyph tables generated from it in
  src/fonts/: Inter, Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 (assets/fonts/OFL.txt).
- The board layer (src/board_display.*, src/board_input.*, src/pin_config.h,
  src/text.*, src/aafont.h) comes from tinyarcana (MIT, same author). The
  CST9217 touch protocol in src/board_input.cpp follows SensorLib (Lewis He,
  MIT).
- Maps generated by scripts/setup.py (src/map_data.h, not in the repository)
  contain OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database
  License (ODbL). Credit OpenStreetMap wherever you show the device.
- Departures come from OVapi (v0.ovapi.nl) and stop and vehicle data from
  gtfs.ovapi.nl, both built on open Dutch public transport data (NDOV).
